flowchart TB
  U[User] -->|Text / Voice| CH[Channel Adapters<br/>Slack · Teams · Discord · WhatsApp · Telegram · Local UI]
  CH --> GW[Gateway Normalizer<br/>Unified Message Envelope]

  subgraph Core["Akasha Core (24/7 Daemon)"]
    GW --> MA[Main Agent<br/>Ack < 500ms · UX · Status]
    MA --> ORCH[Orchestrator Agent<br/>Task Decomposition · Scheduling]
    ORCH --> BUS[Event Bus<br/>NATS (standalone/cluster)]
    MA --> BUS
    BUS --> WDG[Watchdog & Self-Healing<br/>Health · Restart · Isolation]
    WDG --> BUS

    MA --> POL[Policy Engine<br/>RBAC/ABAC · Prompt-Injection Guard · Output Redaction]
    ORCH --> POL

    POL --> PLUG[Plugin Host<br/>WASM Sandbox · Signed Plugins]
    PLUG --> BUS

    subgraph Data["Data Plane"]
      MEM[Memory Store<br/>SQLite/Postgres + pgvector] 
      VAULT[Secrets Vault<br/>OS Keychain / Encrypted Vault]
      LOG[Immutable Append-Only Log<br/>Hash Chain · Signatures]
    end

    BUS --> MEM
    POL --> VAULT
    BUS --> LOG
  end

  subgraph Models["Model Layer"]
    EXT[External LLM APIs]
    LOC[Local Primary Model]
    CORE[Akasha Core Model (Offline)<br/>Onboarding · Diagnostics · Validation]
    ROUTER[Model Router<br/>Fallback · Degraded Mode]
    MA --> ROUTER
    ROUTER --> EXT
    ROUTER --> LOC
    ROUTER --> CORE
  end

  subgraph Cluster["Cluster Mode (optional)"]
    COORD[Coordinator Node]
    WORK[Worker Nodes]
    BUS <--> COORD
    BUS <--> WORK
  end